@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-39 - Cancel Order

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Checkout / Payment UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail, coupons" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-39
FE -> API: POST /payments/orders/:orderCode/cancel-refund
API -> Service: Execute Cancel Order
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail, coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Đơn hàng bị hủy

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Đơn hàng đã SHIPPING -> không thể hủy
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đơn hàng ở status CONFIRMED hoặc PENDING
Post: Đơn hàng bị hủy
Main flow:
1. Admin chọn đơn hàng
2. Admin bấm Cancel Order
3. Admin nhập lý do hủy
4. System gọi API POST /payments/orders/:orderCode/cancel-refund
5. System cập nhật status = CANCELLED
6. System hoàn stock (nếu đã trừ)
7. System gửi email thông báo
end note
@enduml
